# Copy to .env.local (never committed) to try Google Drive backup on your own machine.
#
# This is the OAuth *client ID* from Google Cloud Console: a public identifier that ends in
# .apps.googleusercontent.com. It is not a secret and it is the only Google value the app needs.
# Never put a client secret, API key or token in this file or anywhere in the project.
#
# Left empty, the app works as before and Settings says Google Drive backup is not set up.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
